WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,530
Driving to Luhu at night and running this far doesn’t burn any gas.

2
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:10,890
You'd better not make any more trouble tonight

3
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,060
Qiu Yu is involved in a poisoning case

4
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,260
You follow the fire

5
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:17,060
It’s not good for you, brother, don’t worry

6
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,060
We promise nothing happened today

7
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,500
This clue is very important

8
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:32,510
But next time, don’t do such a dangerous thing by yourself. It’s really possible.

9
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:39,360
Please explain it to us in advance. Thank you for your cooperation.

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:40,620
We'll check right away
